messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nZhang, Wang and Zhao work in the same department. One of them is the director, one is the secretary and one is an engineer. It is known that Wang, Zhao is taller than the engineer, Secretary is shorter than Wang, Zhang and secretary are not the same height.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following can be inferred?\n# Options:\nA) Zhang is the director, wang is the engineer and zhao is the secretary.\nB) Zhang is the engineer, wang is the director and zhao is the secretary.\nC) Zhang is the director, wang is the secretary and zhao is the engineer.\nD) Zhang is the secretary, wang is the director and zhao is the engineer.', "<think>.\nTo solve this problem, let's analyze the given information step by step:.\n\n1.We know that Zhang, Wang, and Zhao work in the same department.\n2.One of them is the director, one is the secretary, and one is an engineer.\n3.Wang is taller than the engineer.\n4.The secretary is shorter than Wang.\n5.Zhang and the secretary are not the same height.\n\nNow, let's consider the options:.\n\nA) Zhang is the director, Wang is the engineer, and Zhao is the secretary.\n- This option contradicts the information that the secretary is shorter than Wang.Since Zhao is taller than the engineer, Zhao cannot be the secretary.\n\nB) Zhang is the engineer, Wang is the director, and Zhao is the secretary.\n- This option contradicts the information that the secretary is shorter than Wang.Since Zhao is taller than the engineer, Zhao cannot be the secretary.\nAccording to the analysis provided, the correct answer is not C) Zhang is the director, Wang is the secretary, and Zhao is the engineer.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
