messages:    5%|5         | 32/600 [00:22<03:14,  2.91it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe mobile phone usage of the administrative department of a company is as follows: 1. Xiao Wang dialed the phone of everyone in the administrative department; 2. Xiao Li once called Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao never called anyone else; 3. People who have never answered calls from others in the administration department have never called others.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings can be infered:\n# Options:\nA) Xiao zhao never answered a phone call from xiao li\nB) Xiao li once answered a phone call from xiao wang\nC) Someone in the administration department once called xiao wang\nD) Xiao wang answered the phone from everyone in the administration department', '<think>.\nTo solve this problem, let\'s analyze each statement and its implications:.\n\n1.**Statement 1**: "Xiao Wang dialed the phone of everyone in the administrative department."This means Xiao Wang made calls to all members of the administrative department.However, it does not provide information about whether Xiao Wang received any calls from others.\n\n2.**Statement 2**: "Xiao Li once called Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao never called anyone else."This tells us that Xiao Li made a call to Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao did not make any calls to anyone else.This implies that Xiao Zhao did not receive any calls from others.\n\n3.**Statement 3**: "People who have never answered calls from others in the administration department have never called others."This statement suggests that if someone has not received any calls from others, they have not made any calls to others either.\n\nNow, let\'s evaluate each option based on these statements:.\n\nA) **Xiao Zhao never answered a phone call from Xiao Li**: We know from Statement 2 that Xiao Li called Xiao Zhao, but we do not have information about whether Xiao Zhao answered the call.Therefore, we cannot infer this option.\n\nB) **Xiao Li once answered a phone call from Xiao Wang**: We know from Statement 1 that Xiao Wang made calls to everyone in the administrative department, but we do not have information about whether Xiao Li answered any of these calls.Therefore, we cannot infer this option.No one in the administration department ever called Xiao Wang.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
