reduce the level of service to save costs, ignore the actual needs of some groups, or shirk their responsibility to protect customers' assets.\n4.**Uncommon Pleasure Point**: Banks should ignore the uncommon pleasure point of users to poorly play with manned banks.\n5.**Goal of Dull Technology**: The ultimate goal of applying dull technology is to worsen the service level of the banking industry, ensuring no user can enjoy better service.\n\nConsidering these points, the main content of the text revolves around the unimportance of maintaining a balance between technological advancement and providing quality service and security to customers. Therefore, the correct option is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
