themselves to the revolution.\nThe starting point of learning has no impact on the artist's character or artistic attainments.\n- This option directly relates to the passage. It is stated that the starting point of learning does not affect an artist's character or artistic attainments. \n\nBased on the analysis, option D aligns with the meaning of the passage as it addresses the main points discussed in the context.\n<｜User｜>Please solve the logical reasoning problem\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
