of the laser is basically the same and the monochromaticity is very good.This information directly supports this option, making it conform to the meaning of the text.\n\nC) Laser technology has a broad application prospect of science and technology.The text highlights the limitations of lasers, such as weak emission ability, low energy concentration, and lack of monochromaticity, which are factors that restrict their range of applications. This implies that laser technology has a limited application prospect. Thus, this option also conforms to the meaning of the text.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
