vity of urban roofs and road surfaces has no impact on global average temperature, indicating a lack of effort in addressing global warming, making this option incorrect.\n\nA) The surface of dark materials has weak reflectivity.\n- The context implies that enhancing the reflectivity of urban roofs and road surfaces can increase the global average temperature.This indicates that the surface of dark materials has a strong reflectivity.Therefore, this option can be confirmed as correct based on the given information.\n\nAccording to the analysis, the correct options are A and D\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
