 public buildings are well designed, but some poorly designed public buildings were originally intended for private use.ttherefore, the poorly designed public buildings were all originally designed for private use.\n- This option presents a flawed argument because it incorrectly assumes that all poorly designed public buildings were originally intended for private use.The original intention of a building does not necessarily determine its design quality.\nAlthough all government buildings are designed by famous architects, not all government buildings are well proportioned.ttherefore, some government buildings are well proportioned.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
