 claims that if everyone followed Myrna's advice, only a very small percentage of people would live longer, and those who did would gain only a few months of life.\n\n3.**Evaluating Myrna's Response**: Myrna responds to Roland by pointing out that many people suffer from serious chronic diseases due to high-fat diets.Myrna's response completely ignores Roland's argument and focuses solely on the statistical accuracy of high-fat diets, rather than addressing the broader health impacts.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
