rred by a mobile phone enterprise in setting up a product upgrade award in the company to improve the quality of mobile phones - This option involves setting up an award to encourage quality improvement, which is a form of prevention cost.Therefore, this is a prevention cost.\n\nThis option involves advertising to promote sales, which does not directly relate to preventing defects or improving quality. Instead, it focuses on increasing sales. Therefore, this is a prevention cost.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is not D) The advertising cost of printing brochures or video materials during the regular preferential activities held by a shopping website.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
