e outside of government guarantees and the market.\n\nB) Professor zhang has never bought a house.He believes that buying a house is not as good as renting a house, and renting a house is not as good as borrowing a house - This option describes a professor who has never bought a house, but it does not address the issue of being unable to buy a house outside of government guarantees and the market.\n\nBased on the analysis, the least likely option to be a sandwich layer is D) Xiao li, Xiao wang, and Xiao liu who have just been recruited by the company live in a temporary warehouse of the company.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
