mperature).This is an example of environmental effects.The reclamation of the sea by a coastal city to construct an island led to the establishment of a small town accommodating 70,000 individuals. This scenario illustrates positive environmental impacts as it showcases human intervention resulting in the creation of new habitats and ecosystems.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
