n\n2.**Option B**: Chen has worked as a deputy director of the magazine for 20 years, and although he has published some personal works, he has not been promoted.\n   - This option describes a situation where Chen's ability to advance in his career has declined over time.However, it does not specifically mention any decline in his ability to control the environment, make choices, or initiate behaviors.Therefore, this option does not fully align with the definition of self-depletion.\n\n3.**Option C**: Song mou do sales work for nearly ten years, although he changed four or five companies, but because the performance is average, the income has not changed.\nOption D illustrates a scenario in which Wang's competence in his role as an archive administrator has significantly improved over the years, and he actively seeks opportunities for career advancement. This directly contradicts the concept of self-depletion, which involves a decrease in ability or motivation to influence the environment, regulate behavior, and make decisions. Therefore, Option D is the best choice.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
