 us understand the potential impact of the AMT plan on the tax revenue generated by the city and whether it would be profitable to implement the plan.Consequently, the incorrect solution is not B) The dollar amount of the tax deductions the top 10% of salary recipients in Carina are presently claiming.\n</ponder>.\n<solution>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
